<h2 id=3D"intuition">Intuition</h2>
<p>Let=E2=80=99s start by finding a sorting algorithm that allows us to sor=
t a linked list.</p>
<p><strong>Choosing a sorting algorithm</strong><br>
<!-- -->We're tasked with sorting a linked list, not an array. This distinc=
