<p>With that established, how would we merge two longer linked lists? To do=
 this, we can set two pointers, one at the start of each linked list, then =
perform the following steps:</p>
<ol>
<li>
<p>Compare the nodes at each pointer and add the node with the smaller valu=
e to the merged linked list.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Advance the pointer at that node with the smaller value to the next node=
 in its linked list.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Repeat the above two steps until we can no longer advance either pointer=
.</p>
</li>
</ol>
